      "title": "XY Plot & Lora",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# XY Plot\nOutputs the generated images arranged side by side as a single image, with each image corresponding to one element.\n\nThis can be safely bypassed or removed if not needed, and it will still function properly.\n\n- XY Input: The number of images to generate is specified using the **Seeds++ Batch** node.\n- Other XY nodes contain many useful options for comparison, which is why this specification is used.\n\n# EasyLoraStack\nThis node allows you to load multiple LoRAs at once.\n\n- **toggle**  \n  Enables or disables the LoRA.\n\n- **mode**  \n  Switches to a mode where you can specify the CLIP strength.\n\n- **num_loras**  \n  Specifies the number of LoRAs to load.  \n  Parts where **Lora_name** is set to **None** will not affect the generated image."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
    {
      "id": 534,
